{"4292860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RigidGems Museum", "steam_appid": 4292860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RigidGems Museum</strong> is a collection game where you mine rough stones, cut them into gemstones, collect them, and build your own digital gem museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 59 minerals and more than 500 gemstone cuts. Many of these designs are included with permission from real-world cut designers and rights holders. Even the same mineral can look dramatically different depending on the cut, changing the way it reflects light and displays color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rough stones may also contain fantastical inclusions inspired by flowers, planets, galaxies, and other unusual motifs. This is not a gemstone appraisal simulator. Instead, it combines real-time gemstone rendering with collection elements that are unique to a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minerals such as ammolite also appear, with colors that change depending on the viewing angle and lighting. Collect your favorite gemstones and display them in your own gallery using showcases and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no competition or time limit. Explore minerals, experiment with different cuts, and enjoy beautiful gemstones at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine rough stones from locations around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >59 different minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 500 gemstone cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous designs based on real-world gemstone cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angle-dependent color effects, including ammolite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastical inclusions inspired by flowers, planets, and galaxies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange your finished gemstones in a gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own museum using showcases and display items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed gameplay focused on collecting and viewing gemstones</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RigidGems Museum</strong> runs on a custom-built real-time rendering engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not require a DXR-capable GPU and can also run on GPUs without dedicated RT cores. DXR rendering can be enabled on compatible hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real-time ray tracing benchmark mode is also included, and rendering statistics such as FPS, trace/sec, and rays/pixel can be displayed during normal gameplay.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RigidGems Museum</strong> is a collection game where you mine rough stones, cut them into gemstones, collect them, and build your own digital gem museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 59 minerals and more than 500 gemstone cuts. Many of these designs are included with permission from real-world cut designers and rights holders. Even the same mineral can look dramatically different depending on the cut, changing the way it reflects light and displays color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rough stones may also contain fantastical inclusions inspired by flowers, planets, galaxies, and other unusual motifs. This is not a gemstone appraisal simulator. Instead, it combines real-time gemstone rendering with collection elements that are unique to a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minerals such as ammolite also appear, with colors that change depending on the viewing angle and lighting. Collect your favorite gemstones and display them in your own gallery using showcases and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no competition or time limit. Explore minerals, experiment with different cuts, and enjoy beautiful gemstones at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine rough stones from locations around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >59 different minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 500 gemstone cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous designs based on real-world gemstone cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angle-dependent color effects, including ammolite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastical inclusions inspired by flowers, planets, and galaxies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange your finished gemstones in a gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own museum using showcases and display items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed gameplay focused on collecting and viewing gemstones</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RigidGems Museum</strong> runs on a custom-built real-time rendering engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not require a DXR-capable GPU and can also run on GPUs without dedicated RT cores. DXR rendering can be enabled on compatible hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real-time ray tracing benchmark mode is also included, and rendering statistics such as FPS, trace/sec, and rays/pixel can be displayed during normal gameplay.</p>", "short_description": "RigidGems Museum is a collection game where you mine rough stones, cut them, collect them, and display them to build your own digital gem museum. It features 500+ cuts licensed from real gem cut designers and rights holders, letting you collect and admire a wide variety of gems.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292860/84d9c